-- 26 July 2026, the whole of Article 6: NOTHING, because only paragraph 1 of it is named and a reference to the whole Article is mixed
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as an importer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26 July 2026, Article 9: JUST FALSE (as enacted: "only Article 6(1), Articles 102 to 109 and Article 112 apply": Article 9 is not named)
-- MIRROR Art 2(2): the same Article asked from each operator seat about the same high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as an importer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
