-- 26 July 2026, Article 57, requirements not integrated: JUST FALSE ("Article 57 applies only in so far as the requirements ... have been integrated")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as an importer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
