#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as an importer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, Article 58, requirements integrated: JUST FALSE (as enacted only Article 57 has the conditional sentence; Article 58 is not named)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as an importer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 58 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
