§ `Article 3(3) to (8): does the definition of my role fit me?`

-- Under Article 3(6), as an importer, does the definition of an importer fit me
-- located in the Union, places on the market a system bearing a third-country name: TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(6), as an importer, does the definition of an importer fit me` `Established or located in the Union` TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- located in a third country: FALSE ("located or established in the Union")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(6), as an importer, does the definition of an importer fit me` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- does not place an AI system on the market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(6), as an importer, does the definition of an importer fit me` `Established or located in the Union` FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- the system does not bear a third-country name or trademark: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(6), as an importer, does the definition of an importer fit me` `Established or located in the Union` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

-- Under Article 3(8), as an importer, am I an operator
-- the seat's role is passed as the keel's `Role`: TRUE ("'operator' means a provider, product manufacturer, deployer, authorised representative, importer or distributor"): the role of this seat is on the list
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(8), as an importer, am I an operator` EQUALS TRUE


§ `Article 3(9) to (11): placing on the market, making available on the market, putting into service`

-- Under Article 3(9), as an importer, is my supply of the AI system a placing on the market
-- a first making available on the Union market: TRUE ("the first making available of an AI system or a general-purpose AI model on the Union market")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(9), as an importer, is my supply of the AI system a placing on the market` TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- a making available that is not the first: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(9), as an importer, is my supply of the AI system a placing on the market` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- not a making available on the Union market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(9), as an importer, is my supply of the AI system a placing on the market` FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE

-- Under Article 3(10), as an importer, is my supply a making available on the market
-- a supply for distribution or use on the Union market in the course of a commercial activity: TRUE
-- MIRROR Art 3(10): the same supply asked from the importer and the distributor seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as an importer, is my supply a making available on the market` TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not in the course of a commercial activity: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as an importer, is my supply a making available on the market` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- not for distribution or use on the Union market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as an importer, is my supply a making available on the market` FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 3(23): substantial modification`

-- Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification
-- after placing on the market, not foreseen, compliance affected: TRUE ("a change ... which is not foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment ... as a result of which the compliance ... is affected")
-- MIRROR Art 3(23): the same change asked from the provider, importer, distributor, deployer and notified body seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- after placing on the market, not foreseen, the intended purpose modified: TRUE ("or results in a modification to the intended purpose")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- made before the placing on the market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- neither compliance nor intended purpose affected: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as an importer, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 3(49): serious incident`

-- Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident
-- an incident leading to death or serious harm to health: TRUE (point (a))
-- MIRROR Art 3(49): the same event asked from the provider, deployer, importer, distributor and person seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure: TRUE (point (b))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to the infringement of fundamental rights obligations: TRUE (point (c))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to serious harm to property or the environment: TRUE (point (d))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- an incident that leads to none of the four consequences: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as an importer, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 111(1): components of large-scale IT systems listed in Annex X`

-- Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation
-- 31 July 2024, before entry into force: NOTHING (the Regulation did not exist)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS NOTHING
-- 1 August 2024, the day the Regulation enters into force, an Annex X component placed in 2020: JUST 31 December 2030 ("shall be brought into compliance with this Regulation by 31 December 2030")
-- MIRROR Art 111(1): the date for the same Annex X component, asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 1 August 2027, the day before the placement bound: placed before 2 August 2027, so JUST 31 December 2030 ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2027, the placement bound itself: NOTHING (not "before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS NOTHING
-- not a component of a large-scale IT system: NOTHING (the rule reaches components of the systems listed in Annex X)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE "none" EQUALS NOTHING
-- a component of a large-scale IT system established by an act that Annex X does not list: NOTHING ("the legal acts listed in Annex X")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" EQUALS NOTHING
-- Annex X point 1(c), Regulation (EU) 2018/1862: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1862" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- Annex X point 7(b), the last act of the Annex, Regulation (EU) 2019/818: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2019/818" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted: JUST 31 December 2030 (paragraph 1 was not changed by the Omnibus)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2026, the day the group General (which holds Article 111 itself) begins to apply: JUST 31 December 2030 (the date the paragraph gives does not move on that day)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)

-- Under Article 111(1), as an importer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked
-- an Annex X component placed in 2020: the operator brings it into compliance on day 2343 (31 December 2030, counted from 1 August 2024): discharged
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as an importer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
