§ `Article 111(2), first sentence: is my high-risk AI system saved? (replaced by the Omnibus)`

-- Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), Annex III route, placed 1 August 2026, not changed: TRUE ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2026, only if, as from that date, those systems are subject to significant changes in their designs")
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, placed on 2 August 2026, the date itself: FALSE (not "before 2 August 2026")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, placed 1 August 2026 and significantly changed in its design since: FALSE (the "only if" is met, so the Regulation applies)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE ("operators of high-risk AI systems")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 7 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE ("before the date of application of Chapter III referred to in Article 113": 2 December 2027 for an Annex III system)
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 2 December 2027: FALSE (not before 2 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex I route, placed 2 August 2028: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027 and significantly changed: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 2 August 2026, the general date, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE (as amended; the saving does not stop on the day the group General begins)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as an importer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE


