-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions of seat importer from part P1 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P1-cases-seat-importer: cases for the seat layer of an importer: the facts a real importer would state, one question after another.
-- Every question has at least one case; a case outside the encoding asserts the explicit NOTHING (not covered) where the question has one. The expected answers are written from the text,
-- one fact at a time, as in the layer-1 tests (P1-tests-*.l4). A case marked MIRROR asks the same facts as the partner seat's case file and the answers agree.

§ `Under Article 5: who is asking`

-- Under Article 5, as an importer, am I an importer within the meaning of Article 3(6)?
-- established in the Union and places a third-country-branded system on the market
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as an importer, am I an importer within the meaning of Article 3(6)` `Established or located in the Union` TRUE TRUE
-- established in a third country
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Article 5, as an importer, am I an importer within the meaning of Article 3(6)` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE)

§ `Under Article 5: the prohibited AI practices`

-- Under Article 5, as an importer, does Chapter II apply on the date asked?
